-- M2: the qubit sandwich (U, U^dagger) from |0><0|, path dephasing Delta
   I          P_coh(0)=1  P_deph(0)=1  V=0  |a|^2=1  monomial=True
   X          P_coh(0)=1  P_deph(0)=1  V=0  |a|^2=0  monomial=True
   Z          P_coh(0)=1  P_deph(0)=1  V=0  |a|^2=1  monomial=True
   S          P_coh(0)=1  P_deph(0)=1  V=0  |a|^2=1  monomial=True
   PH         P_coh(0)=1  P_deph(0)=1  V=0  |a|^2=0  monomial=True
   sqrtX      P_coh(0)=1  P_deph(0)=1/2  V=1/2  |a|^2=1/2  monomial=False
   sqrtX^dag  P_coh(0)=1  P_deph(0)=1/2  V=1/2  |a|^2=1/2  monomial=False
   Xrot(3/5)  P_coh(0)=1  P_deph(0)=337/625  V=288/625  |a|^2=9/25  monomial=False
   Rot(3/5)   P_coh(0)=1  P_deph(0)=337/625  V=288/625  |a|^2=9/25  monomial=False
   H          P_coh(0)=1  P_deph(0)=1/2  V=1/2  |a|^2=1/2  monomial=False
   rot(pi/4)  P_coh(0)=1  P_deph(0)=1/2  V=1/2  |a|^2=1/2  monomial=False
M2a      PASS  P_coh=1, P_deph=|a|^4+|b|^4, V=2|a|^2|b|^2, V=0 iff monomial (11 qubit unitaries)
M2b      PASS  owner's witness (1, 1/2) holds exactly for the balanced unitaries: ['H', 'rot(pi/4)', 'sqrtX', 'sqrtX^dag']
M2c      PASS  H then H: P_coh(0)=1, P_deph(0)=1/2

