   cells: (ones-fixing=True, monomial=True): ['I', 'X']; (ones-fixing=True, monomial=False): ['sqrtX', 'sqrtX^dag', 'Xrot(3/5)']; (ones-fixing=False, monomial=True): ['Z', 'S', 'PH']; (ones-fixing=False, monomial=False): ['Rot(3/5)', 'H', 'rot(pi/4)']
M5b      PASS  gateFlow(swap,1/2): ones-fixing (K*1 = 1), non-monomial, balanced; sqrtX sqrtX |0> = |1> (P=1), dephased 1/2; same on 3 points
M5c      PASS  transition flow at pi/4: unitary, non-monomial, moves the ones ray on 3 points (K*1 = [sqrt(2)*(1 - I)/2, sqrt(2)*(1 - I)/2, 1]), fixes it on 2 points

