OK -- 14/14 checks, 6 countercontrols expected-false
VERDICT ENVELOPE-M HOLDS: on the configuration carrier, DC <-> monomial for unitaries; every protocol of the
  monomial class tested (attach, step, readout, feed-forward, coarse, discard) is DC; the sandwich visibility
  of a qubit unitary is 2|a|^2|b|^2 (owner's 1 vs 1/2 exactly for the balanced ones: ['H', 'rot(pi/4)', 'sqrtX', 'sqrtX^dag']);
  ones-fixing is independent of mixing (all four cells populated; gateFlow(swap,1/2) is a ones-fixing
  balanced mixer); DC is a linear subspace, hence closed under mixtures and limits.
